{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c369236be1af07d28e847ee252657c5321b4ec37bdfc39f2001f8fb0916c776",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8fdd114b8429d1efcca33694e26c64e6e45672b9dda76c409dab2b5c76dec8",
      "text": "青蛙王子的梦…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c52c840a32b403016b62e56b52c609112238840f699177d7e5553acd202d6180",
      "text": "皮埃尔离开了因政争而陷入混乱的祖国，\n远渡重洋来到了日本。为了给失去笑容的祖国\n重新带回和平，正独自苦思烦恼的他，\n被保镖们带去游乐园散心。\n在那里，皮埃尔发现的是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000022:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000022:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8fdd114b8429d1efcca33694e26c64e6e45672b9dda76c409dab2b5c76dec8",
      "text": "青蛙王子的梦…",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000024:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a649ec701ef8f83880de4ff6c5b142fd2e071b9cc61cfd7eb982dfee0eba9dd2",
      "text": "某王国的城堡",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59cf4f07e816f7eb7a2bd352d31def13b26b7285e2fac4f029db65b3655ebf76",
      "text": "又是那件事吗……别让我说那么多次！\n大臣们所期望的人选，是我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47141481f6afcdfcd3b5769f3125f760b2c250083ba7f6182c79f33af57e9baf",
      "text": "你说什么，你这家伙怎么可能胜任王位！\n父王若还康健，岂容你如此放肆！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d48a5f54c8b93cdb0bc7ef32feb9a55905c030224dd2064df5c0a2708dc89681",
      "text": "哈，父王如今卧病在床，\n凭你又能做得了什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c46d002991347030f2b77ccb7d2e6d8b31a52164485030676eae93868291d84",
      "text": "给你脸了，你这家伙……！\n给我出去单挑！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f1bf03bd31f6901e8eee1bce3e62e3a1b0e47fc068ed19427bba8c5338796f4",
      "text": "王兄们……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3b530479d17dab7d0e9ad48b9155d77deb40f0b1c56b5376446f991bc70edf0",
      "text": "自从父王倒下后，就总是吵个不停。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fa1d2b4f7eaf4b923f2cd28f9809d1557e74576a27ae48fb8a0cd3d703c74ef",
      "text": "皮埃尔大人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42c051c38a7b5b58de07f7d0c86a21ce2230dacaa168661ff58c6f119607f5de",
      "text": "不仅是王兄们。\n大家全都总是板着生气的脸、悲伤的脸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:953a95db485f79b6cd3ae9818831963533f0d0979a4f17ddaf0a6de9374014fc",
      "text": "起初是家人们，接着是城堡里的大家。\n然后，城镇上的人们也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:622bb922a46416592b952f61691927e398705a7c5671826c28edbaed1fd51f49",
      "text": "如今，整座国家的笑容都消失了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:014aa6c9f1aaf20b4654e5d10427bb095c76b5a8a0622ea45178387824fd72c8",
      "text": "难道就没有什么，是我能做到的吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_01_1_1_004_01:1_1_004_01_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31c47e654a73b1e7e686008911b157435fcfc9edfd686bd108a7679ac86fa090",
      "text": "……关于这件事，其实我有话要向您禀报。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
